By using the Service, the user undertakes to:
- not use the Service for unlawful or fraudulent purposes;
- not infringe the rights of third parties, in particular the image rights of persons who may appear in the uploaded photos or videos;
- not circumvent the security measures of the Service;
- not use the Service or its API outside the official applications without prior authorisation.

Free plan: at no cost, within the limits specified on the pricing page of the Site.
